Latest nouveau_drv.so version string is 0.0.10, but nouveau_dri.so apparently
expects something higher. These two expectations need to be brought in line in
the checked in code or a bit more description on how to overcome this in the
"How to compile and use nouveau" section is needed.

I "hacked" the nouveau_drv.so version string to 1.2.0 in the config.ac and got
it to run. Make my glxgears stats jump from 300+ fps to 1500+ fps!
Unfortunately it froze Linux after about 5 minutes. Still needs some work :-)
So keep up the good work!

